# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository (and on checkout by default),
# regardless of the OS/editor a contributor uses locally. Added 2026-08-20 as
# part of Mission 000 (Repository Preservation and Executable Baseline) — the
# repo previously had no .gitattributes, which allowed Windows checkouts to
# drift to CRLF and made ~99% of the working tree show as "modified" even
# with zero real content changes. See docs/MISSION-000-EXECUTABLE-BASELINE.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never text-normalize these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
